OL,5,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,6,     FLive from St Martin-in-the-Fields
OL,7,     Fto mark the 300th anniversary of
OL,8,     Fthe completion of the building of
OL,9,     Fthe Church, including music by
OL,10,     FNils Greenhow, Klatzow and Cecilia
OL,11,     FMcDowall.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Rameau
OL,13,     F3/5. Donald Macleod delves into
OL,14,     FRameau's ascendency to writing
OL,15,     Fmusic for the court, with his
OL,16,     Fstage works now being performed in
OL,17,     FVersailles.
OL,18,G1700 In Tune
OL,19,     FThe Fergus McCreadie trio play
OL,20,     Flive. Nicolas Namoradze on his
OL,21,     Ftranscription of Beethoven's
OL,22,     FGrosse Fuge.
