OL,5,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,6,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,7,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,8,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,9,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,10,     Feverything in between.
OL,11,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,12,     FSoweto has more exciting new
OL,13,     Freleases and jazz classics, and he
OL,14,     Fhears from his guest all this
OL,15,     Fweek, Tamar Osborn, as she shares
OL,16,     Fa third artist that she admires
OL,17,     Ffor Flowers.
OL,18,G0030 Through the Night
OL,19,     FThe WDR Symphony Orchestra and
OL,20,     Fconductor Ingo Metzmacher perform
OL,21,     FHelen Grime's Near Midnight and
OL,22,     FMahler's 7th Symphony.
